{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202140","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1120214001:1":{"text":"在这场决斗之前，我一直以为我是父亲最引以为傲的孩子。","source_cn":"在这场决斗之前，我一直以为我是父亲最引以为傲的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE27C6E1B89B9A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120214002:1":{"text":"没想到，我竟然会输你，被遗弃的奥格之子……","source_cn":"没想到，我竟然会输你，被遗弃的奥格之子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF90D7B52B20A22A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120214003:1":{"text":"原来，你获得战歌节的胜者之名并非幸运。","source_cn":"原来，你获得战歌节的胜者之名并非幸运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B57685082ED1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120214004:1":{"text":"……你！","source_cn":"……你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38225042382EA62A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120214005:1":{"text":"等等，我没听错吧？索恩是……奥格的儿子？","source_cn":"等等，我没听错吧？索恩是……奥格的儿子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98A2F059CB032CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120214006:1":{"text":"原来你的同伴们还不知道这件事？","source_cn":"原来你的同伴们还不知道这件事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A48F80A7CC4BA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120214007:1":{"text":"索恩是我的兄弟，也是父亲的儿子。但因为他出生时太过孱弱，就被遗弃在了沙漠里。","source_cn":"索恩是我的兄弟，也是父亲的儿子。但因为他出生时太过孱弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF268AE278683AC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120214008:1":{"text":"即使是族长之子，弱小也依然会被丢弃。这就是我们黑嚎氏族的生存法则。","source_cn":"即使是族长之子，弱小也依然会被丢弃。这就是我们黑嚎氏族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0F4F271F3324C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120214009:1":{"text":"……你是怎么做到用如此稀疏平常的语气，说出这么可怕的话的？","source_cn":"……你是怎么做到用如此稀疏平常的语气，说出这么可怕的话的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x992CCDC29C404866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120214010:1":{"text":"毫无人情，只论实力的黑嚎氏族。你们总是擅自给别人打下强弱的标签。","source_cn":"毫无人情，只论实力的黑嚎氏族。你们总是擅自给别人打下强...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282E770D899FABA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120214011:1":{"text":"而在看到昔日的“弱者”凭借自身的力量变强之后，你们又一转之前的态度，试图把他收入麾下……","source_cn":"而在看到昔日的“弱者”凭借自身的力量变强之后，你们又一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC355401288FD8069","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120214012:1":{"text":"真是太可笑了，我要离开这里!","source_cn":"真是太可笑了，我要离开这里!","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF331BF656B890D06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库金":{"text":"库金","source":"库金","status":"source"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"索恩","source":"索恩","status":"source"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"阿尔萨","source":"阿尔萨","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}